- the orange oval on the house wall (in the plate, right beside the board);
- the pale salmon drum mouth, as bright as the notice;
- the chair as bright as the notice (rule 5's 'dirty the chair' is never tested);
- the flat beige lamp glass;
- the black lamp-post foot under the board;
